# Oliva's environment contract: the variables of the default stack that need more than
# a copied placeholder. One line per variable:
#
#   NAME   SLOT   KIND   VALUE
#
# SLOT  the role the variable belongs to (the slot names of docs/roadmap.md):
#       backend, realtime, database, queue, scheduler, frontend, gateway.
#       A slot whose service isn't running doesn't need its variables.
# KIND  secret    generated; safe to replace at any time
#       stateful  a secret bound to a data volume: the service stored it the first time
#                 it started. Changing the variable alone locks the app out of its data,
#                 so `env init` only generates it when there is no value yet
#       derived   computed from other variables (written once, never typed twice)
#       plain     not secret; listed because a derived value or a check needs it
# VALUE gen:hexN  N random bytes, hex-encoded
#       same:VAR  must equal VAR
#       -         no rule: the placeholder of .env.example, or a value a person provides
#       anything else is a template for a derived value; ${VAR} is replaced
#
# This file is Oliva's. An app declares ITS variables in ./env.manifest (same format).
# Every variable here must also be in .env.example, with a placeholder.

APP_SECRET                  backend   secret    gen:hex32
JWT_PASSPHRASE              backend   secret    gen:hex32

# SYMFONY_TRUSTED_PROXIES has a baked default in backend/Dockerfile
# (PRIVATE_SUBNETS), so it does not need a manifest row; env-check.sh flags an
# EMPTY SYMFONY_TRUSTED_HEADERS directly (a known-bad config). GATEWAY_*_UPSTREAM
# have defaults in gateway/Caddyfile; env-check.sh reads them on the gateway
# service and reports a slot REPLACED when an upstream host is not Oliva's.

MERCURE_PUBLISHER_JWT_KEY   realtime  secret    gen:hex32
MERCURE_JWT_SECRET          realtime  secret    same:MERCURE_PUBLISHER_JWT_KEY

POSTGRES_USER               database  plain     -
POSTGRES_DB                 database  plain     -
POSTGRES_VERSION            database  plain     -
POSTGRES_PASSWORD           database  stateful  gen:hex16
DATABASE_URL                database  derived   postgresql://${POSTGRES_USER}:${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}@database:5432/${POSTGRES_DB}?serverVersion=${POSTGRES_VERSION}&charset=utf8

RABBITMQ_USER               queue     plain     -
RABBITMQ_PASSWORD           queue     stateful  gen:hex16
RABBITMQ_DSN                queue     derived   amqp://${RABBITMQ_USER}:${RABBITMQ_PASSWORD}@rabbitmq:5672/%2f
